              "mathematics": "For price increase x, income is I=(8+x)(200-10x)=-10x^2+120x+1600, on 0≤x≤20. The vertex is (6,1960); the displayed endpoints are (0,1600) and (20,0). Horizontal major ticks are 0,2,…,20; vertical major ticks are 0,200,…,2000.",
